  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">100 children from Manchay improve their wellbeing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ruwa Seeds Project develops the social and emotional skills of 100 children from Manchay, Lima, Peru. The children will participate in arts, sports, and play workshops to strengthen their confidence and self-esteem. We will share a report every three months with an update on the project&apos;s impact on the children and their families. Our children are between 3 and 14 years old.</narrative>
  </description>
